00:57:47.350 --> 00:58:01.650
<v Ira Glass>Well, our program was produced today by Jonathan Goldstein and myself, with Alex Blumberg, Wendy Dorr, and Starlee Kine. Senior producer for today's show was Julie Snyder.
<v Ira Glass>好吧，我们的节目今天由乔纳森·戈德斯坦和我自己制作，还有亚历克斯·布伦伯格、温迪·多尔和斯塔莉·凯恩。今天的资深制作人是朱莉·斯奈德。

00:58:01.650 --> 00:58:12.530
<v Ira Glass>Contributing editors for today's show-- Susan Burton, Rebecca Carroll, Jack Hitt, Margie Rockland, Alix Spiegel, Paul Tough, Nancy Updike, and consigliere Sarah Vowell. Music help today from Jamie Hodge and Sarah Vowell.
<v Ira Glass>今天的特约编辑——苏珊·伯顿、丽贝卡·卡罗尔、杰克·希特、玛吉·罗克兰、阿利克斯·斯皮格尔、保罗·托夫、南希·厄普代克，以及顾问萨拉·沃威尔。音乐支持来自杰米·霍奇和萨拉·沃威尔。

00:58:12.530 --> 00:58:27.110
<v Ira Glass>Our website, ThisAmericanLife.org. This American Life is delivered to public radio stations by PRX, the Public Radio Exchange. Thanks, as always, to our program's co-founder, Mr. Torey Malatia, who explained some recent decisions at the radio station this way.
<v Ira Glass>我们的网站是 ThisAmericanLife.org。《美国生活》由公共广播交换平台 PRX 发送给公共广播电台。一如既往地感谢我们节目的联合创始人托雷·马拉蒂亚先生，他以这种方式解释了电台最近的一些决定：

00:58:27.110 --> 00:58:33.820
<v Jon Ronson>I think you ought to know that I'm going through a creative stage, which some people find difficult to connect to.
<v Jon Ronson>“我觉得你应该知道，我正在经历一个创意阶段，有些人觉得很难与之产生共鸣。”

00:58:33.820 --> 00:58:38.820
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass, back next week with more stories of This American Life.
